---
layout: base.njk
lang: en
title: Blog - Maciej Czerpiński
description: Articles by Maciej Czerpiński on Event Storming, Domain-Driven Design, and AI-assisted software development.
permalink: /blog/index.html
---
<section>
  <h1>{{ copy.en.blogIndex.heading }}</h1>
  {% for post in collections.post %}
  <div class="blog-list__item">
    <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
    <p class="blog-list__date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</p>
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <p class="blog-empty">{{ copy.en.blogIndex.empty }}</p>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
